Instead of points 3 & 4 you could replace it with...  <i>3. Load SQL module from CPAN</i>.<p>Something like SQL::Abstract (<a href="https://metacpan.org/module/SQL::Abstract" rel="nofollow">https://metacpan.org/module/SQL::Abstract</a>) or Fey (<a href="https://metacpan.org/module/Fey" rel="nofollow">https://metacpan.org/module/Fey</a>) would slot in easy for most tasks like this:<p><pre><code>  use SQL::Abstract;
  my $sql = SQL::Abstract->new;

  $dbh->do( $sql->delete("my_table") );</code></pre>
